<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the third day of the $750,000 men's Rotterdam World Indoor tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Tomas Carbonell (Spain) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 7-5 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>8-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Jason van Herck (Belgium) 7-6 (7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 7-5 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
